# The modem firmware is a virtual-SIM build (E977_VSIM). mtkfusionrild
# picks the SIM mode at start: persist.vendor.radio.multisimslot=2 gives
# dsds, then ro.vendor.mtk_non_dsda_rsim_support=1 together with
# ro.vendor.radio.max.multisim=tsts adds a third protocol stack for the
# virtual SIM. Nothing ever provisions it, so that slot keeps searching
# for a network and polling the modem. device.mk overrides max.multisim;
# this asks for the two physical slots. rild writes the result to
# persist.radio.multisim.config, which the framework reads.
on post-fs-data
    setprop persist.vendor.radio.multisimslot 2
